cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "cranebench: a reproducible benchmark for the control of underactuated crane systems"
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying article."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sheremet
    given-names: Oleksii
    affiliation: "Donbas State Engineering Academy"
