    given-names: Serhii
    affiliation: "Donbas State Engineering Academy"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21785505
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-03
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/spodlesny2318-arch/Cranebench"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark for underactuated crane control. Fixes the plants,
  the disturbance models, the paired uncertainty design, the metric module and
  the provenance ledger, and supplies five classical baselines and no novel
  controller, so that a new controller can be evaluated against a bench its
  author did not build.
keywords:
  - crane control
  - underactuated systems
  - reproducibility
  - benchmark
  - Monte Carlo
